// M5-A3P-1014. Ch21 H02 "Two lamps" (C, 2.5 min). act3_ending.md §2 H02, §0 rule 8.
// Imra at the centre, her light holding the storm together; Dace beside her, his hands in her light, keeping it whole.
// Dace can't turn or speak while he holds her. Rhen sees his father. HE WALKS, HE DOESN'T RUN (an answer to his Ch8
// freeze). He stops an arm's length away because Kerrid's hand is on his shoulder. Sefir is already there, waiting.
// NO GOODBYE HERE: the withheld one. FRAMING (rule 8): the wide holds Imra, Dace and Rhen; KERRID'S HAND ON RHEN'S
// SHOULDER IS ONLY IN RHEN'S SINGLE (shot HT05); we see Dace's back, never his face, until E2. `heart_approach` thins to
// silence on Sefir's first word. T-08 (optional insert): if ch19_learned_the_hitch, Rhen's hands tie Dace's hitch on
// his father's lamp-line; no line.
title: ch21_two_lamps
location: ch21/heart
---
@letterbox on
@camera HT03
@mark rhen arms_length walk
@wait 5.0
@camera HT04
@wait 3.0
@camera HT05
@anim kerrid hand_on rhen
@wait 3.0
<<if $ch19_learned_the_hitch>>
    @camera HT06
    @anim rhen tie_hitch dace_lamp_line
    @wait 4.0
<<endif>>
@camera HT07
@music silence fade=0.0
Sefir [tender]: Lady Cantor. #line:ch21_lamps_001
@wait 2.0
Sefir [neutral]: You came all the way down. Of course you did. #line:ch21_lamps_002
@wait 3.0
@letterbox off
===
